      "type": "html",
      "id": "desc",
      "label": "Description",
      "default": "<p>Ulikeは、美しさ以上に自信に満ちたすべての人を応援してきました。</p><p>革新的な技術によって、世界中のお客様の美しさをサポートしています。</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "id": "note",
      "label": "Note",
      "default": "<p>*1 出典：Euromonitor International Limited；家庭用光美容器小売販売台数において。</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Images"
    },
    {
      "type": "image_picker",
      "id": "image_pc",
      "label": "Main image PC"
    },
    {
      "type": "image_picker",
      "id": "image_mobile",
      "label": "Main image Mobile"
    },
    {
      "type": "image_picker",
      "id": "map_image",
      "label": "Map image PC"
    },
    {
      "type": "image_picker",
      "id": "map_image_mobile",
      "label": "Map image Mobile"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Video"
